{"id":"n48602-1-8","stage":4,"title":"동요 · 摇晃","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48602-1-8-1","ko":"왜 갑자기 차가 동요를 하는 거지?","zh":"为什么车突然开始颠簸了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"차가","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차가","audio":"/audio/c4429920a017c41c1ed5.mp3"}},{"text":"동요를","meaning":"摇晃，摇动","explanation":"동요：摇晃，摇动；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"동요","audio":"/audio/4fb922c7724e9669ec67.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48602","senseId":"1","lemma":"동요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동요를","audio":"/audio/ec2b839d471a16a5a636.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거